entColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m11 5-6 4H2v6h3l6 4V5ZM15.5 8.5a5 5 0 0 1 0 7M19 5a10 10 0 0 1 0 14\"/></svg></button></div>",
